      "spam": false,
      "value": "From the #faq channel on the discord:\n\n\"I’d like to change the name on my VRChat account.\nPlease first check to see if you are using a Steam account.  You will know this as your account will have a combo of letters and numbers after your name.  If you are using a Steam account, please signup for an account at https://www.vrchat.com/ with the new desired name.  If you already have a VRChat account, please email support@vrchat.com.  Make sure you are emailing from the same email you used to create the account and mention this in the email.  Also put your original name and the desired name you wish to change to.\"",
